<!--HTML--><html><body><p>Powerhouse Design Architects &amp; Engineers, Ltd., of Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, protests the terms of eight Sources Sought Notices (SSN) issued by the Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) for architect-engineering (A/E) services. The protester, a service-disabled veteran-owned small business (SDVOSB) concern, asserts that the agency improperly failed to set aside these procurements for such firms.</p></body></html>
